      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Genola%2C_Minnesota"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Genola sits in east-central Morrison County, surrounded on three sides by Pierz Township and north by the city of Pierz.",
